  "description": "AnyLLM is a chat app that puts you in control: talk to AI through cloud or fully local providers, with no account and no API keys to manage. Your conversations and settings stay on your device—we don’t collect or store your chats.\n\nPRIVACY & SECURITY\n• Your chats and settings are stored only on your device—we have no access to them\n• No account required—use the app without signing up\n• Cloud access is configured automatically—no API keys to copy or manage\n• Use fully local AI with Ollama or LM Studio so your data never leaves your network\n\nMULTIPLE MODELS, ONE APP\n• Cloud Models — browse and use many AI models; access is set up for you automatically\n• Ollama — run models locally on your computer; connect via your Ollama server URL\n• LM Studio — run models locally with LM Studio; connect via your LM Studio server\n• Switch providers and models anytime from the menu\n\nVOICE IN, VOICE OUT\n• Voice input — speak your messages; speech is converted to text (edit before sending)\n• Optional “Send” by voice or auto-send after silence for hands-free use\n• Text-to-speech — hear responses read aloud as they’re generated\n• Choose system TTS or in-app speech; adjust voice and speed to your preference\n\nMORE FEATURES\n• Light, dark, or system theme; customizable fonts and sizes\n• Full chat history stored on your device; start new chats or reopen past ones\n• Send images where your chosen model supports it\n• Clear or delete chats anytime; you control your data\n\nAnyLLM works on phone, tablet, and desktop. Set up your preferred provider, pick a model, and start chatting—with your data staying local and secure.",
